      "Target": "Data/NPCGiftTastes",
      "Entries": {
        "{{ModId}}_Auden": "Oh! You remembered. I'm going to be insufferably happy about this all week.$l/395 74 595 414 72/That's lovely, thank you. Truly.$h/86 84 82 614 611 80/Ah. I'll... find a use for it. Somewhere. Eventually./92 330/@, I'm going to pretend this was a hex gone wrong.$a/168 167 283//"
